      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, a little caffeine can be a good pick-me-up, but remember, too much can lead to jitteriness or insomnia. Try a cup of coffee in the morning and maybe a can of cola in the afternoon. Just keep an eye on how you feel, and don't overdo it. And remember, your meds are there to help, so don't ditch them for a quick fix. Good luck with your finals!",
