      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i was thinking of maybe doing more than just coffee though. like i have these 200mg caffeine pills in my desk, i was thinking of maybe taking one of those if i hit a wall around 2pm? or maybe just crushing 2 energy drinks back to back if i'm really lagging. i don't really get the \"jitters\" much from caffeine anyway so i feel like i could handle a bit more to stay sharp. what do u think about using the pills?",
